Edit, I thought it could be similar to what i was having problems with. However I see now its not. <br><br>I did come up with a workaround, you can use boxes that overlap your mesh and use that as a hitting point for the collision. <br>Then make them invisible using a game actuator, I tested this and it works<br><br>As far as advanced meshes for colision, it seems there is either another solution im unaware of or its a bug.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=1557">darkelfv</a> — Tue Jan 16, 2007 5:49 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
